# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore file for deploy/images/kernel/Dockerfile.
#
# The kernel image's build context is the repository ROOT, whose working
# checkout carries ~839 MB of node_modules. Without this file every build would
# upload all of it.
#
# It lives here rather than at the repo root because the root `.gitignore`
# ignores `.dockerignore` (a pre-existing "Preview Docker test setup" rule), so
# a root ignore-file could not be committed alongside the deployment it belongs
# to. BuildKit resolves `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` relative to the context
# and prefers it over the context root's `.dockerignore`.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Local runtime state is never shipped in.
midnight-level-db*
packages/batcher/batcher-data

.git
.github
docs/dist
docs/node_modules
*-debug.log
.DS_Store

# The deployment's own generated state must never enter an image layer.
deploy/.env
deploy/**/.env
